n vectors of the endpoints of the curve are given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(0) & =⟨0,0⟩, \\\\ r(1) & =⟨\\frac{\\pi }{2},1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApplying the fundamental theorem for line integrals, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}∇f\\cdot \\text{d}r & =f(r(1))-f(r(0)) \\\\  & =f(\\frac{\\pi }{2},1)-f(0,0) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})\\operatorname{cos}⁡1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡0\\operatorname{cos}⁡0 \\\\  & =0\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡1-1\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535447 true] [17592186349647 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349648 13194139535447 true] [17592186349647 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349649 13194139535447 true] [17592186349647 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349650 13194139535447 true] [17592186349647 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349651 13194139535447 true] [17592186349647 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349652 13194139535447 true] [17592186349647 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535447 true] [17592186349647 1041 "selection" 13194139535447 true] [17592186349647 1104 #edb/ref 17592186349652 13194139535447 true] [17592186349647 1110 #uuid "d78b716a-32a8-5831-a13e-9e2b296d092c" 13194139535447 true] [17592186349648 1034 "\\frac{\\pi }{2}+1" 13194139535447 true] [17592186349648 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535447 true] [17592186349648 1111 #uuid "19037058-b9b6-54eb-bd2f-e3337a19104b" 13194139535447 true] [17592186349649 1034 "\\frac{\\pi }{2}-1" 13194139535447 true] [17592186349649 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535447 true] [17592186349649 1111 #uuid "740e2bf3-edc9-5461-8b34-c7666d1850aa" 13194139535447 true] [17592186349650 1034 "1-\\frac{\\pi }{2}" 13194139535447 true] [17592186349650 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535447 true] [17592186349650 1111 #uuid "dc80d883-65bb-5ae8-8591-c2e7cc55abf0" 13194139535447 true] [17592186349651 1034 "1+\\pi " 13194139535447 true] [17592186349651 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535447 true] [17592186349651 1111 #uuid "d15fca75-8925-5cb9-8917-46e36a98191e" 13194139535447 true] [175921863